      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's an interesting idea. I like the idea to be able to set your own custom nameplate color. I also like the current player status color system. I think if the nameplates were to be allowed customizable colors, it should be followed by another ring outside of the player custom nameplate color for what status the player is. Moreover, in addition to this idea, it would also be really cool to set custom nameplate designs (like name plate designs found in call of duty games). Perhaps nameplate designs could be done in the avatar SDK or on the VRChat website.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
